From 85edb3fcf35a51082e749ba0665a14097f3a335d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 09:42:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Schema v1.6: parent_face_id on openings, width/height/gable
 on wall faces

- shared/schema/measurement-v1.6.json (additive; v1.5 data still validates)
- extract-photo/plan/mixed prompts: WALL DIMENSION RULE, OPENING PARENT RULE,
  deliverable lines and definitions
- compute.js + berechnung.ts port: net wall area grouped by parent_face_id
  (removes the A7 skip for multi-face elevations), dormer check uses the
  wall's own height, new width x height (+gable) vs area_mm2 consistency check
- validate-assemble.js + port: parent_face_id must exist, wall dimension
  plausibility, openings-vs-gross cross-check per wall face
- schema path repointed in validateMeasurement.ts, prompts.ts, tests, docs
- fixture: schema_version 1.6, parent_face_id on all 20 openings, wall
  dimensions from footprint/eave/ridge/garage geometry (area_mm2 unchanged)

